{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>自選主菜烤牛扒+任食長腳蟹/鮑魚/船麵</p><p>觀塘 I-O-N泰式主題半自助餐</p><p>觀塘 I-O-N由即日起至9月30日推出泰式主題 半自助餐 ，網上商店預訂更可享高達「買 2 送 2」優惠，午市$248起、晚市最平$398起。可以任食冰鎮海鮮、日式刺身、冷肉盤、泰式船麵、沙嗲串燒、泰式甜品、Häagen‑Dazs 雪糕，仲可以自選一款主菜，性價比超級高！</p><p>自選西泰fusion菜！</p><p>主菜方面，提供多款西泰fusion菜，當中包括烤澳洲安格斯肉眼配泰國鹹魚賓尼士醬、泰式大虎蝦椰香意大利粉、泰式鹹魚脆烤羊鞍扒、泰式烤黃油雞半隻等。晚市時段更設有即席烹調檔，輪流供應的豬肉沙嗲串燒、泰式米餅、香蘭葉雞、泰式船麵等。仲有多款泰式甜點：珍多果凍椰汁西米露、椰汁西米糕等。</p><p>凡預訂半自助晚餐六位起，仲免費送芒果糯米飯一客。</p><p>觀塘I-O-N 地址：觀塘創業街38號九龍東如心酒店2樓�電話： 6508 0975 (WhatsApp) 網上商店： https://ninaboutique.com/zh/restaurant-offers-ion 官方IG：@ionhongkong</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178625522995797727_2701580726a78177e86a54.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178625523252981562_16658435946a781780be13a.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178625523400697399_3213663386a7817824b264.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178625523567685688_1706373316a781783ebf10.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178625523720961945_8942288716a781785aa9c8.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178625523915678842_18025910656a781787eb08b.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178625524210656227_10589992166a78178a52dcf.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-09T08:54:34.214778+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":554,"images":7,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}